 {"file_name": "ekran-4-pano.png", "id": "1128903779647642", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1128903792980974_9096671177552013989_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4yd59jDAK4AQ7kNvwE_reRo&_nc_oc=AdqylRgY8wWqHvM1XAuC1R6xDIZzYFv9NwGINpZVVoZtkn1TSK9nm78NGXwe_hsYDbc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTOG1LmYr4_FIuhki6ucl58JtUSq3IgKWyLR-ERQZKQNQ&oe=6B05ADD6"}, {"file_name": "ekran-5-hitabe.png", "id": "1677100294038389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1677100297371722_427800699000792108_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uyC29pCKoJ8Q7kNvwF_BQ9K&_nc_oc=AdpdKm2b8oMkSjoTOp63ZPfKIH7T5qCeUF4I8QfpC5oO8jW4-vZIlymGIlZYxBzZXxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRW_SNBAARFbq-RGyo82KK-S2vSgICYEXUxqM7cWydlNg&oe=6B05C06B"}, {"file_name": "ekran-1-kursu.png", "id": "1470949048316551", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_1470949051649884_6806826258171000962_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZB0MZvYWZWAQ7kNvwFrOf86&_nc_oc=AdpqeRD34W7AmWKZ4GkFQY-sg1nujrPfXwJRtJg8VZ7GkNFUQuSQHmTiIAFxqjNvMLY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQvdH5Y2NVITp-ydL8FEBCik_9qgwFPkNHsQyBwylZzZg&oe=6B05CA0D"}, {"file_name": "ekran-2-harita.png", "id": "1080727764967192", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_1080727768300525_4165269507240939875_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tRCXSuAKpcYQ7kNvwGYTKzW&_nc_oc=AdoZK1v66QMjzYSG8i3xBiHhwn-0sKBsixvXjWUe9kbUN3MXGA6TMpHEBh29anNMKRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvjFUR88SdaZGInUjvnH6L3pxccbfStB4R-q-CYE_hVw&oe=6B05D351"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nutuk Salonu", "keywords": ["Atat\u00fcrk", "history", "education", "Turkey", "museum"], "long_description": "October 1927, Ankara. Take a seat in the parliament hall as afternoon light streams through the tall windows. The rostrum is empty; above it, the lines of Nutuk, Atat\u00fcrk's great speech, appear one by one, each with its meaning in today's Turkish.\n\n- 18 chapters, from the landing at Samsun to the Address to the Youth.\n- The Road to Independence: a relief map of Anatolia on a tactics board with 12 stops, from Istanbul to Izmir. Point at a pin to open that chapter on the rostrum.\n- Timeline and \"Did you know?\" boards on the walls of the hall.\n- Read at your own pace or let the lines advance on their own.\n- Touch controllers or hand tracking. Teleport by pointing at the floor; snap turn with the thumbstick. Comfortable seated or standing.\n- Works offline. No ads, no accounts, no data collection.\n\nThe app's text is in Turkish. Atat\u00fcrk's works are in the public domain; the original lines were checked against the full text of Nutuk on Wikisource.", "short_description": "Sit in the 1927 Turkish Parliament hall: the original lines of Atat\u00fcrk's Nutuk appear above the empty rostrum with their meaning in today's Turkish beneath, while a relief map of the road to independence waits on the table in front of you."}]}, "developer_name": "Mr. Anduv!", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emreanduv.github.io/nutuk-salonu/gizlilik.html?v=2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mr. Anduv!", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/emreanduv/nutuk-akisi/issues", "website_url": "https://emreanduv.github.io/nutuk-salonu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_are